body:
I think your signatures are computed wrong. We compute HMAC-SHA256 of the payload with our endpoint secret and it never matches the Vantimere-Signature header.

Our code (Node/Express):
app.use(express.json());
...
const expected = hmacSha256(secret, JSON.stringify(req.body));

We log "signature mismatch" on every single delivery. Secret is definitely correct, I copied it again this morning.
